  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2102.17 Minor project",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.17 “Minor project” means any activity at an asbestos disposal site that involves the excavation, removal, exposure, or other disturbance of asbestos, or any material mixed with or containing asbestos that is not a major project The term does not include a major project divided into smaller segments.\n\nSource. #12605, eff 9-1-18 (formerly Env-Sw 2102.09)",
